stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft: trader.bookTrade
  Draft --> Unreviewed: trader.submitTradeToExecution
  Unreviewed --> Unreviewed: execution.updateOpenTrade
  Unreviewed --> AwaitingPrice: unfixed basis submitted
  AwaitingPrice --> Unreviewed: trader.completeTradePrice
  Unreviewed --> AwaitingTraderReview: execution edits trade
  AwaitingTraderReview --> Locked: trader.lockTrade
  Unreviewed --> Locked: execution.lockOpenTrade
  Locked --> Executed: autoClose received gt contract plus tolerance
  Locked --> PendingClose: trader.submitChangeRequest CLOSE
  PendingClose --> Executed: ceo.resolveApproval
  Executed --> [*]

  note right of Unreviewed
    warehouseSplitApproved required
    before lock when warehouse profile
  end note
